{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">網上瘋傳影片，港鐵灣仔站月台上打架事件。片中一名身穿民族服裝、手持長條狀物體的長髮男子，在月台上與一名南亞裔男子爆發激烈口角，期間長髮男情緒極為激動，更不斷大力用腳踏地，疑向對方高聲叫囂。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-29-11h56m13s889.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026pL1NF6vlWJ1785298852.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-29-11h56m13s889.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-29-11h56m02s364.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/202619qc8QHktt1785298853.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-29-11h56m02s364.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據影片顯示，兩人初時僅為口角爭執，惟長髮男子隨後突然衝向該名南亞裔男子，對方反應極為迅速，即時出手箍着長髮男子的頸部，順勢將其壓倒在地，並連續向其身上揮打數拳，現場有途人連忙上前勸阻阻架。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-29-11h55m41s879.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026NgAGnuWKEC1785298853.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-29-11h55m41s879.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-29-11h55m46s366.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026r1iM9YWPlc1785298853.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-29-11h55m46s366.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">警方表示，今日（29 日）凌晨時分接獲一名 22 歲非華裔男子報案。報案人指較早前在列車車廂內，因「眼神問題」與一名年約 70 歲的男子發生爭執。報案人隨後在灣仔站往堅尼地城方向月台下車並報警求助。警員接報趕至現場時，該名年約 70 歲的涉案男子已經離去。警方目前已將案件暫列作「糾紛」跟進處理。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T06:58:54.184296+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":338,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}